### 3.1 Login com senha incorreta
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "marcos@logistica.com",
    "senha": "errada"
}

### 3.2 Fazer Login de Marcos
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "marcos@logistica.com",
    "senha": "123"
}


### 4. Testar rota protegida com Token invalido
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas
Authorization: tokeninvalido

### 5. Testar CPF com tamanho incorreto
POST http://localhost:3000/motorista
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "nome": "Teste Cpf",
    "cnh": "12345678901",
    "cpf": "1234",
    "telefone": "4799990000"
}

