### 25.1 Listar Entregas ordenadas por data crescente
GET http://localhost:3000/entregas?ordem=ASC
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 25.2 Listar Entregas ordenadas por data decrescente
GET http://localhost:3000/entregas?ordem=DESC
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 26. Atualizar status da Entrega
PUT http://localhost:3000/entregas/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "status": "ENTREGUE"
}
